Package: OrdinalRegressionViz
Type: Package
Title: Visualize Ordinal Probit Regression Models with 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tomer", "Zipori", email = "tomerzip@post.bgu.ac.il",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Publication-ready 'ggplot2' visualizations for ordinal probit
    regression models fitted with the 'ordinal' or 'brms' packages, framed in
    signal detection theory (SDT) terms: receiver operating characteristic
    (ROC) curves with uncertainty bands, latent-distribution plots with
    response thresholds, grouped posterior predictive checks, and forest
    plots for Bayesian random-effects meta-analyses. The visualizations
    accompany Simchon, Zipori, Teitelbaum, Lewandowsky, and van der Linden
    (2026) <doi:10.1016/j.copsyc.2025.102194>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tomerzipori/OrdinalRegressionViz,
    https://tomerzipori.github.io/OrdinalRegressionViz/
BugReports: https://github.com/tomerzipori/OrdinalRegressionViz/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
